{
  "slug": "vibesurfer",
  "name": "Vibesurfer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A real browser for your local AI agent. Native WebKit on macOS, WebKitGTK on Linux, WebView2 on Windows,\nwith a wire protocol designed for LLMs instead of for humans staring at DevTools. Login once, scrape\nJS-rendered pages, fill forms, take screenshots, drive your own app for smoke tests.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `debug-failed-action` (When your last `vs_act` returned an unexpected result (NOT_FOUND, no visible state change, suspected silent failure), run this…), `vibesurfer` (Agent-native headless browser)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `vibesurfer`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install vibesurfer@claude-community` from `frane/vibesurfer` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
